WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.524
Unit seven. The Digestive System!

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.471
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.521 --> 00:00:12.174
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.224 --> 00:00:16.133
Today we learn about The Digestive System. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.824 --> 00:00:20.591
Digestion. Say it with me. Digestion!

6
00:00:24.095 --> 00:00:27.428
Stomach. Say it with me. Stomach!

7
00:00:30.928 --> 00:00:35.045
Intestine. Say it with me. Intestine!

8
00:00:38.549 --> 00:00:42.249
Saliva. Say it with me. Saliva!

9
00:00:45.735 --> 00:00:48.719
Chew. Say it with me. Chew!

10
00:00:52.202 --> 00:00:55.469
Fiber. Say it with me. Fiber!

11
00:00:58.969 --> 00:01:02.969
Nutrients. Say it with me. Nutrients!

12
00:01:06.497 --> 00:01:10.080
Waste. Say it with me. Waste!

13
00:01:13.585 --> 00:01:23.999
Digestion starts in the mouth, where I chew food and saliva softens it. The stomach and intestine break food down so my body can absorb nutrients. Fiber helps move waste out of the body.

14
00:01:24.049 --> 00:01:25.211
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.576 --> 00:01:31.715
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.765 --> 00:01:32.915
Intestine!

17
00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:39.685
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.735 --> 00:01:40.951
Nutrients!

19
00:01:42.106 --> 00:01:47.627
Did you know? Your small intestine is several metres long, folded up inside your belly!

20
00:01:47.677 --> 00:01:49.764
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.132 --> 00:01:58.884
Think and answer. Why is it important to chew your food well?

22
00:01:58.934 --> 00:02:00.084
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.232 --> 00:02:05.968
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.018 --> 00:02:08.623
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

